{%- comment -%}
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
STORY HERO (Gruffalo character and cast pages, and the story templates: character.story.json, audiobook.story.json)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Most visitors to these pages come from Google (often Images), look for ~10 seconds and scroll about a quarter of the
page, so the ways to hear and buy the story sit in the first screen, next to the picture they came for:
* left: eyebrow, H1, intro, the one-minute sample (same player as everywhere else: .bookpreview), then two routes
  side by side: "At home" (starter pack card, live price and saving) and "In the classroom" (email sign-up for
  classroom ideas, snippets/school-signup.liquid, and the school packages link), then "just the audiobook"
* right: the character artwork (setting, else the metaobject's first photo, else the first photo of the first item in
  the metaobject's "list" field, which is how the cast page gets the Gruffalo)

On the character template the H1 and intro above are for the main character (setting "Main character handle");
Owl, Fox and Snake, which share the template, get "[name] in The Gruffalo" and their own description instead.
Prices and the saving are read live from the products; nothing is hard-coded.

Story templates (character.story / audiobook.story, first used for Dave Pigeon, 26 Oct 2026): every empty setting
falls back to the page's own story, so one template serves any character or audiobook. Audiobook = the audiobook
entry's product or the character's main book; artwork = character photo, else the audiobook cover; intro = the
character's description, else the audiobook's short blurb; starter pack = "Find the pack that holds this story"
(snippets/story-pack-handle.liquid). Text settings take [name], [name_in_book], [book], [book_short], [author],
[narrator] and [more].
Tracking: PostHog `story_hero_click` { target: pack | audiobook | schools | secondary, page } and `school_signup`
{ form: hero, page } (voxblock.js); the sample already sends `sample_played`.
Why two routes: Gruffalo pages get far more weekday-daytime and desktop visits than the rest of the site (teachers).
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  # The story behind the page: an audiobook entry itself, or a character's main book. Used for the fallbacks below
  # and the [book] / [book_short] / [author] / [narrator] / [more] words in the text settings.
  assign work = blank
  if metaobject.system.type == 'audiobook'
    assign work = metaobject
  elsif metaobject.main_book.value != blank
    assign work = metaobject.main_book.value
  endif

  assign book = section.settings.audiobook
  if book == blank and work != blank
    assign book = work.product.value
  endif

  assign art = section.settings.image
  assign art_is_cover = false
  if art == blank and metaobject.photos.value != blank
    assign art = metaobject.photos.value | first
  endif
  if art == blank and metaobject.list.value != blank
    assign first_item = metaobject.list.value | first
    assign art = first_item.photos.value | first
  endif
  if art == blank and book.featured_media != blank
    assign art = book.featured_media.preview_image
    assign art_is_cover = true
  endif

  assign pack = section.settings.pack
  if pack == blank and section.settings.match_pack and book != blank
    capture pack_handle
      render 'story-pack-handle', book: book, packs_collection: section.settings.packs_collection, player_handle: 'voxblock-player'
    endcapture
    assign pack_handle = pack_handle | strip
    if pack_handle != blank
      assign pack = all_products[pack_handle]
    endif
  endif
  assign preview_file = book.metafields.book.preview

  if pack != blank
    assign pack_variant = pack.variants | sort: 'price' | first
    assign pack_save = 0
    if pack_variant.compare_at_price > pack_variant.price
      assign pack_save = pack_variant.compare_at_price | minus: pack_variant.price | times: 100.0 | divided_by: pack_variant.compare_at_price | round
    endif
    assign pack_more = pack.metafields.bundles.products.value.size | minus: 1 | at_least: 0
  endif

  assign book_price = book.price | money

  # Words that can be used in the text settings
  assign t_name = metaobject.name.value | default: metaobject.title.value | strip
  assign t_book = work.title.value | default: book.title | strip
  assign t_book_short = t_book | split: ':' | first | strip
  assign t_author_obj = work.authors.value | first
  assign t_author = t_author_obj.name.value | default: t_author_obj.name | strip
  assign t_narrator_obj = work.narrators.value | first
  assign t_narrator = t_narrator_obj.name.value | default: t_narrator_obj.name | strip
  # [name_in_book]: "Skipper in Dave Pigeon", or just "Dave Pigeon" when the name is already in the book title
  assign t_name_in_book = t_name
  if t_book_short != blank and t_book_short != t_name
    unless t_book_short contains t_name
      assign t_name_in_book = t_name | append: ' in ' | append: t_book_short
    endunless
  endif

  # Pages other than the main character (e.g. Owl, Fox, Snake on the Gruffalo template) get their own H1 and intro
  assign heading = section.settings.heading
  assign intro = section.settings.intro
  if section.settings.main_handle != blank and metaobject != blank and metaobject.system.handle != section.settings.main_handle
    assign heading = section.settings.heading_others
    assign intro = ''
    if metaobject.description.value != blank
      assign intro = metaobject.description.value | escape | prepend: '<p>' | append: '</p>'
    endif
  endif
  if heading == blank
    assign heading = '[name]'
  endif
  # No intro set: the character's one-line description, or the audiobook's short blurb
  if intro == blank and section.settings.main_handle == blank
    if metaobject.description.value != blank
      assign intro = metaobject.description.value | escape | prepend: '<p>' | append: '</p>'
    elsif metaobject.concise_blurb.value != blank
      assign intro = metaobject.concise_blurb | metafield_tag
    endif
  endif

  assign heading = heading | replace: '[name_in_book]', t_name_in_book | replace: '[name]', t_name | replace: '[book_short]', t_book_short | replace: '[book]', t_book
  assign intro = intro | replace: '[name]', t_name | replace: '[book_short]', t_book_short | replace: '[book]', t_book | replace: '[author]', t_author
  assign eyebrow = section.settings.eyebrow | replace: '[name]', t_name | replace: '[book_short]', t_book_short | replace: '[book]', t_book | replace: '[author]', t_author
  assign play_label = section.settings.play_label | replace: '[name]', t_name | replace: '[book_short]', t_book_short
  assign sample_note = section.settings.sample_note
  if t_narrator == blank and sample_note contains '[narrator]'
    assign sample_note = 'Free, no sign-up.'
  endif
  assign sample_note = sample_note | replace: '[narrator]', t_narrator | replace: '[name]', t_name
  assign pack_contents = section.settings.pack_contents | replace: '[book_short]', t_book_short | replace: '[book]', t_book | replace: '[more]', pack_more | replace: '[author]', t_author

  assign art_alt = section.settings.image_alt
  if art_alt == blank
    assign art_alt = art.alt
  endif
  if art_alt == blank and art_is_cover
    assign art_alt = t_book | append: ' audiobook cover'
  endif
  if art_alt == blank and t_name != blank
    assign alt_book = t_book | default: 'The Gruffalo'
    assign art_alt = t_name | append: ' from ' | append: alt_book
  endif
-%}

<section class="story-hero" style="--story-hero-bg: {{ section.settings.background }};" data-story-page="{{ request.path | escape }}" {{ section.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="container story-hero__inner">
    <div class="story-hero__text">
      {%- if eyebrow != blank -%}<p class="story-hero__eyebrow subheading">{{ eyebrow | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
      <h1 class="story-hero__title">{{ heading | escape }}</h1>
      {%- if intro != blank -%}<div class="story-hero__intro">{{ intro }}</div>{%- endif -%}

      <div class="story-hero__actions">
        {%- if preview_file != blank -%}
          <div class="story-hero__sample-row">
            <button type="button" class="series-button series-button--secondary bookpreview story-hero__sample" aria-controls="product-sample" aria-expanded="false" data-mp3="{{ preview_file | file_url }}" data-title="{{ book.title | escape }}">
              <span class="playpause"></span>
              <span class="playpause_text">
                <span class="play">{{ play_label | escape }}</span>
                <span class="pause">{{ section.settings.pause_label | escape }}</span>
              </span>
              <span class="sr-only">{{ 'collection.story_hero.play_sample' | t }}</span>
            </button>
            {%- if sample_note != blank -%}<p class="story-hero__sample-note">{{ sample_note | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        <div class="story-routes">
          {%- if pack != blank and pack.available -%}
            <a href="{{ pack.url }}" class="story-route story-route--home" data-story-track="pack">
              <span class="story-route__label">{{ section.settings.home_label | escape }}</span>
              <span class="story-route__row">
                {%- if pack.featured_media -%}
                  <span class="story-route__media">{{- pack.featured_media | image_url: width: 240 | image_tag: loading: 'eager', sizes: '64px', widths: '64,128,240', alt: '' -}}</span>
                {%- endif -%}
                <span class="story-route__body">
                  <span class="story-route__title">{{ pack.title | escape }}</span>
                  {%- if pack_contents != blank -%}<span class="story-route__text">{{ pack_contents | escape }}</span>{%- endif -%}
                  <span class="story-route__prices">
                    <span class="story-route__price">{{ pack_variant.price | money }}</span>
                    {%- if pack_variant.compare_at_price > pack_variant.price -%}
                      <s class="story-route__was"><span class="sr-only">{{ 'product.price.regular_price' | t }}</span>{{ pack_variant.compare_at_price | money }}</s>
                      <span class="story-route__save">{{ 'product.general.discount_badge_html' | t: savings: pack_save | append: '%' }}</span>
                    {%- endif -%}
                  </span>
                </span>
              </span>
              <span class="story-route__more">{{ 'collection.story_hero.see_pack' | t }}</span>
            </a>
          {%- endif -%}

          {%- if section.settings.show_classroom -%}
            <div class="story-route story-route--class">
              <span class="story-route__label">{{ section.settings.classroom_label | escape }}</span>
              <span class="story-route__title">{{ section.settings.classroom_title | escape }}</span>
              {%- if section.settings.classroom_text != blank -%}<span class="story-route__text">{{ section.settings.classroom_text | escape }}</span>{%- endif -%}
              {%- render 'school-signup', form_id: 'hero', list_id: section.settings.signup_list_id, source: section.settings.signup_source -%}
              {%- if section.settings.schools_url != blank -%}
                <a href="{{ section.settings.schools_url }}" class="story-route__link" data-story-track="schools">{{ section.settings.classroom_link_label | escape }}</a>
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>

        <p class="story-hero__links">
          {%- if book != blank and book.available -%}
            <span>{{ 'collection.story_hero.have_player' | t }} <a href="{{ book.url }}" data-story-track="audiobook">{{ 'collection.story_hero.just_audiobook' | t: price: book_price }}</a></span>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if section.settings.secondary_url != blank and section.settings.secondary_label != blank -%}
            <span><a href="{{ section.settings.secondary_url }}" data-story-track="secondary">{{ section.settings.secondary_label | escape }}</a></span>
          {%- endif -%}
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    {%- if art != blank -%}
      <div class="story-hero__art">
        {{- art | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'eager', fetchpriority: 'high', sizes: '(max-width: 699px) 60vw, 40vw', widths: '300,450,600,900', alt: art_alt -}}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Story hero",
  "tag": "div",
  "class": "shopify-section--story-hero",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "color", "id": "background", "label": "Background", "default": "#fff7f0" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading (H1)", "default": "What is a Gruffalo?", "info": "Can use [name], [name_in_book] (e.g. Skipper in Dave Pigeon), [book] and [book_short] (title before any colon)." },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "intro", "label": "Intro" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "main_handle", "label": "Main character handle", "info": "On other pages using this template the H1 below is used, with the page's own description as intro." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading_others", "label": "H1 on other character pages", "default": "[name] in The Gruffalo", "info": "[name] = the character's name." },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image", "label": "Artwork", "info": "Leave empty to use the page's character photo, else the audiobook cover." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "image_alt", "label": "Artwork description" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Listen and buy" },
    { "type": "product", "id": "audiobook", "label": "Audiobook (sample + \"just the audiobook\")", "info": "Empty: the audiobook of this page (an audiobook entry's product, or a character's main book)." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "play_label", "label": "Sample button", "default": "Hear the Gruffalo" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "pause_label", "label": "Sample button while playing", "default": "Playing sample" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "sample_note", "label": "Line under the sample button", "default": "One minute, read by Imelda Staunton. Free, no sign-up.", "info": "Can use [narrator] and [name]." },
    { "type": "product", "id": "pack", "label": "Starter pack" },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "match_pack", "label": "Find the pack that holds this story", "default": false, "info": "Used when no starter pack is picked above." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "packs_collection", "label": "Collection to find the pack in", "default": "voxblock-starter-pack-collection" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "home_label", "label": "Home card label", "default": "At home" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "pack_contents", "label": "Starter pack contents line", "default": "Voxblock player + 3 Julia Donaldson stories", "info": "Can use [book], [book_short], [author] and [more] (the number of other stories in the pack)." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Classroom card" },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_classroom", "label": "Show the classroom card", "default": true },
    { "type": "text", "id": "classroom_label", "label": "Label", "default": "In the classroom" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "classroom_title", "label": "Title", "default": "Bring audiobooks into your classroom" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "classroom_text", "label": "Text", "default": "Whole-class listening and screen-free reading corners. Get ideas and school offers by email." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "signup_list_id", "label": "Klaviyo list ID for sign-ups", "default": "XRcgpd", "info": "Schools Monthly Email Newsletter." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "signup_source", "label": "Sign-up source (shown in Klaviyo)", "default": "Story page: classroom card" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "schools_url", "label": "School packages link" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "classroom_link_label", "label": "School packages link text", "default": "School packages, with 10% off for schools" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "secondary_label", "label": "Extra link text" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "secondary_url", "label": "Extra link" }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Story hero" }]
}
{% endschema %}
